  "id": "isotretinoin",
  "term": "isotretinoin",
  "definition": "Isotretinoin is a medicine that has been linked in pharmacovigilance reports to a wide range of possible adverse events, with psychiatric events reported more often than expected alongside gastrointestinal and pregnancy-related events. The meaning of some newer safety signals is still uncertain, so reported associations should be interpreted cautiously.",
